      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "862. 查表求下列方程的根（准确到 0.01）：",
        "а) $5x^2-x-1=0$；　б) $2x^2+7x+4=0$；",
        "в) $3(y^2-2)-y=0$；　г) $y^2+8(y-1)=3$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "863",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "863. 解下列方程：",
        "а) $0.7x^2=1.3x+2$；　б) $7=0.4y+0.2y^2$；",
        "в) $x^2-1.6x-0.36=0$；　г) $z^2-2z+2.91=0$；",
        "д) $0.2y^2-10y+125=0$；　е) $\\frac{1}{3}x^2+2x-9=0$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "864",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "864. 存在使下列等式成立的 $a$ 值吗？",
        "а) $3a+0.6=9a^2+0.36$；",
        "б) $0.4a+1.2=0.16a^2+1.44$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "865",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "865. 用两种方法（利用公式和把方程左边分解因式）解下列",
        "不完全的二次方程：",
        "а) $12x^2+7x=0$；　б) $x^2-25=0$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "866",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "866. 设下列方程没有根，求 $t$ 值的集合：",
        "а) $3x^2-2x+t=0$；　в) $4x^2+tx+1=0$；",
        "б) $5x^2+18x+t=0$；　г) $48x^2+tx-5=0$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "867",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "867. 设下列方程有两个根，求 $v$ 值的集合：",
        "а) $10x^2+40x+v=0$；　б) $2x^2+vx+18=0$；",
        "в) $vx^2-6x+1=0$；　г) $7x^2+vx-25=0$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "868",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "868. $k$ 是什么数时，下列方程有一个根？",
        "а) $16x^2+kx+9=0$；　б) $15x^2-90x+k=0$；",
        "в) $kx^2-100x+k=0$；　г) $25x^2+kx+2=0$."
      ]
    },
